name: The Family — four-of-a-kind X4
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Family gives X4 Mult if the played hand contains a Four of a Kind. First-shop X4
  engine: commit to Four of a Kind; use DNA to duplicate key ranks and the Planet for it.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: TheFamily
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheIdol
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
